  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cao Bang Waste Water Treatment Plant Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will construct a wastewater treatment plant to cover 312 ha, which will connect 3,416 households to its sewerage system. The capacity of the treatment plant will be 3,000 m3/day and will be able to service 20,500 people during its first phase. The plant is designed to allow for a later expansion to service 34,000 people.</narrative>
  </description>
